WP:DescVector
"Main battle tank. Heavy armor and a long-range gun; strong against vehicles and structures, weak against rocket infantry and aircraft. Requires a Vehicle Plant."
END

WP:DescFabricator
"Construction vehicle. Builds and repairs Meridian structures. Unarmed; keep it behind your lines and replace it if it is lost."
END

WP:DescPowerArray
"Generates 12 power. Meridian production and defenses slow down or stop when power runs short, so build one before your second production structure."
END

WP:DescVehiclePlant
"Produces Meridian vehicles: Vector tanks, Outrider scout cars and Zenith artillery. Uses 3 power."
END

WP:DescOutrider
"Fast scout car with a machine gun and a wide sight range. Good against infantry and for finding the enemy; weak against tanks and defenses."
END

WP:DescZenith
"Self-propelled artillery. Very long range and a large blast against structures and grouped units; cannot fire at close range and has thin armor. Keep it behind tanks."
END

WP:DescVulture
"Fast, cheap raiding truck with a light gun. Good for scouting and for attacking haulers and unguarded structures; loses a straight fight with tanks or defenses."
END

WP:DescMongrel
"Light battle tank. Cheap and quick to build; wins by numbers rather than armor. Weak against rocket infantry. Requires a Chop Shop."
END

WP:DescRigger
"Construction vehicle. Builds and repairs Jackal structures. Unarmed; keep it behind your lines and replace it if it is lost."
END

WP:DescBulwark
"Automated gun turret. Strong against vehicles and infantry that come within range. Needs power to fire and cannot attack aircraft."
END

WP:DescChopShop
"Produces Jackal vehicles: Mongrel tanks and Vulture raiders. Needs no power."
END

WP:DescWatchpost
"Guard tower with a cannon. Holds off ground attacks near your base; cannot attack aircraft. Build Flakhuts for air defense."
END

WP:DescCancelConstruction
"Stops construction and refunds the full cost. Hotkey: C."
END

