WP:MapTraining
"Field Orientation"
END

WP:MapTrainingDesc
"Learn the basics: train a builder, set up supplies and power, build an army, scout, then destroy the enemy headquarters. Guidance follows your progress."
END

WP:Objective_training_0
"Train a Fabricator from your headquarters."
END

WP:Objective_training_1
"Construct an Exchange and a Power Array, then train a Porter."
END

WP:Objective_training_2
"Construct a Vehicle Plant and field two Vectors."
END

WP:Objective_training_3
"Train a Vigil to scout the central approach."
END

WP:Objective_training_4
"Destroy the hostile headquarters. Protect your own."
END

WP:MapOp01
"01 - First Light"
END

WP:MapOp01Desc
"Establish an Exchange and Vehicle Plant, then destroy the Jackal relay beyond the ridge passes. Protect your headquarters; destroying the enemy base is optional."
END

WP:Objective_op01_0
"Establish an Exchange and a Vehicle Plant."
END

WP:Objective_op01_1
"Destroy the Front's forward relay. Protect headquarters."
END

WP:MapOp02
"02 - Cut the Wire"
END

WP:MapOp02Desc
"Raid both supply offices and the grid substation around the basin. Destroy all three targets while protecting your command post. Vultures can exploit gaps in the garrison."
END

WP:Objective_op02_0
"Destroy both supply offices and the grid substation (0/3)."
END

WP:MapOp03
"03 - The Long Watch"
END

WP:MapOp03Desc
"Hold the forward relay for eight minutes, then destroy the Jackal command post. Keep both the relay and your headquarters alive throughout the operation."
END

WP:Objective_op03_0
"Defend the forward relay for eight minutes."
END

WP:Objective_op03_1
"Destroy the enemy command post. Keep the relay and headquarters alive."
END

WP:MapOp04
"04 - War Powers"
END

WP:MapOp04Desc
"Break the two air-defense sites in the scrapyard, then destroy the occupation headquarters. Ground raiders open the way for aircraft. Protect your command post."
END

WP:Objective_op04_0
"Destroy the two marked air-defense sites (0/2)."
END

WP:Objective_op04_1
"Destroy the occupation headquarters. Protect your command post."
END

WP:MapChallengeM
"Glass Rampart"
END

WP:MapChallengeMDesc
"Keep the relay and headquarters alive for ten minutes under Rook's siege. Repair between volleys and raid the two forward mortar pits to reduce pressure."
END

WP:Objective_challenge-meridian_0
"Keep the supply relay and headquarters alive for ten minutes."
END

WP:MapChallengeJ
"Hostile Takeover"
END

WP:MapChallengeJDesc
"Destroy Vale's forward headquarters within nine minutes. Start with a mobile raiding force, choose a pass and strike before reinforcements arrive. Protect your command post."
END

WP:Objective_challenge-jackal_0
"Destroy the enemy headquarters within nine minutes."
END

WP:PrecisionStrike
"P&recision Strike"
END

WP:DescPrecisionStrike
"Calls a heavy strike on the target three seconds after you mark it. Best against grouped vehicles and structures. Recharges in 150 seconds. The target must be on explored ground."
END

WP:TunnelAmbush
"&Tunnel Ambush"
END

WP:DescTunnelAmbush
"Brings three Scrappers and two Stings out of a tunnel at the target. Recharges in 120 seconds. The target must be clear, explored ground."
END

